    "body": "I present you negative-slop.\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nRepeated default fields and field-by-field assertions obscure the values that each functional test is meant to check.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAdd `eq_partial()` to check selected record fields while preserving list length and order. Use local helpers to fill fixed expected defaults where tests need full equality. Keep explicit absence checks and test-specific values at the call sites.",
