            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Drive-by suggestion/question: `eq_partial` -> `contains`?\r\n\r\n`eq_xx` is more discoverable since it aligns with `eq()`. \r\n\r\n(no comment on `t.matches` , though in general if we weren't so eager to alias things then `t.xx()` instead of `xx()` would help discoverability on its own)",
